OL,5,G0110 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FEleven-year-old William has been
OL,7,     Fhit by a car and thrown 30 feet.
OL,8,     FSixty-eight-year-old Stephen is
OL,9,     Fstruggling to breathe. And Ryan
OL,10,     Fhas broken his arm while playing
OL,11,     Frugby.
OL,12,G0210 999: On the Front Line
OL,13,     FAs paramedics treat a woman with
OL,14,     Fchest pains, she goes into cardiac
OL,15,     Farrest. A young boy has signs of
OL,16,     Fcroup, and a man's collapsed in a
OL,17,     Fpool of his own vomit.
